    "v0.3 rules were written from the misses in the first hard test set, so that set is NO LONGER BLIND and its score is optimistic. Before v0.3, the rules caught 9 of its 18 serious cases (0.50).",
    "The second hard test set (hard_test_v2) was committed before the v0.3 rules were written and was not used to choose them, so it is the fairest number here. Before v0.3 the rules caught 12 of its 26 serious cases (0.46). It was written by the same person as the v0.3 rules, so even this score may be optimistic. A test set written by someone outside the team is the next step."
